msgid "# Tensor R-Fork (RFork) Guide"
msgstr "# Tensor R-Fork（RFork）指南"

msgid "This guide explains how to use **Tensor R-Fork** as a model-loader plugin in **vLLM Ascend**."
msgstr "本指南介绍如何在 **vLLM Ascend** 中使用模型加载器插件 **Tensor R-Fork**。"

msgid "## TL;DR"
msgstr "## 太长不看"

msgid "**Tensor R-Fork** stands for **Tensor Remote Fork** and is abbreviated as **RFork**. It is a warm-start weight loading path for vLLM Ascend. Instead of always reading model weights from storage, a new instance can request a compatible **seed** instance from an external planner, then pull weights directly from that seed through `YuanRong TransferEngine`."
msgstr "**Tensor R-Fork** 的全称是 **Tensor Remote Fork**，简称 **RFork**。它是 vLLM Ascend 的一种热启动权重加载方式。新实例无需每次都从存储读取模型权重，而是可以向外部规划器请求兼容的 **seed** 实例，再通过 `YuanRong TransferEngine` 直接从该 seed 拉取权重。"

msgid "The \"fork\" is a remote tensor-level operation, not an operating-system process fork. RFork treats the NPU memory of an existing vLLM instance as a reusable weight source; the destination creates an independent model instance and reads the seed's registered tensors into its pre-allocated NPU parameter buffers."
msgstr "这里的“fork”是远程张量级操作，并非操作系统的进程 fork。RFork 将现有 vLLM 实例的 NPU 内存作为可复用的权重源；目标端会创建独立的模型实例，并将 seed 已注册的张量读入预先分配的 NPU 参数缓冲区。"

msgid "## Background"
msgstr "## 背景"

msgid "For large models, repeatedly loading the same checkpoint can make storage and host-side staging the main startup bottlenecks. RFork changes the warm-start data path for later replicas:"
msgstr "对于大模型，重复加载同一个检查点时，存储访问和主机侧暂存可能成为启动过程的主要瓶颈。RFork 改变了后续副本的热启动数据路径："

msgid "| Load weights from | Data flow | Typical bottleneck |"
msgstr "| 权重来源 | 数据流 | 典型瓶颈 |"

msgid "| Remote storage | Remote storage → remote network → local network interface → local host DRAM → local NPU memory | Storage or network bandwidth |"
msgstr "| 远端存储 | 远端存储 → 远端网络 → 本地网络接口 → 本地主机 DRAM → 本地 NPU 内存 | 存储或网络带宽 |"

msgid "| Local disk | Local disk → host DRAM → NPU memory | Disk bandwidth |"
msgstr "| 本地磁盘 | 本地磁盘 → 主机 DRAM → NPU 内存 | 磁盘带宽 |"

msgid "| Local host DRAM | Host DRAM → NPU memory | Host-to-device interconnect |"
msgstr "| 本地主机 DRAM | 主机 DRAM → NPU 内存 | 主机到设备互连 |"

msgid "| RFork seed instance | Seed NPU memory → YuanRong TransferEngine → destination NPU memory | Inter-node transport bandwidth |"
msgstr "| RFork seed 实例 | Seed NPU 内存 → YuanRong TransferEngine → 目标端 NPU 内存 | 节点间传输带宽 |"

msgid "This design provides the following benefits for scale-out deployments:"
msgstr "该设计为横向扩容场景带来以下优势："

msgid "- **Faster warm starts** by reusing tensors that are already resident on another NPU instance."
msgstr "- **加快热启动**：复用已驻留在其他 NPU 实例上的张量。"

msgid "- **Less repeated storage traffic** because later replicas do not need to read the complete checkpoint again when a compatible seed is available."
msgstr "- **减少重复存储流量**：存在兼容 seed 时，后续副本无需再次读取完整检查点。"

msgid "- **Less host-side staging** because TransferEngine reads registered tensor ranges into the destination's final NPU buffers."
msgstr "- **减少主机侧暂存**：TransferEngine 将已注册的张量范围读入目标端最终的 NPU 缓冲区。"

msgid "- **Lower source-side disruption** because the seed exposes registered memory instead of reloading or broadcasting the model through vLLM workers. Actual inference impact still depends on the inter-node transport, available bandwidth, and concurrent transfer load."
msgstr "- **降低对源端的干扰**：seed 暴露已注册内存，而不是通过 vLLM worker 重新加载或广播模型。实际推理影响仍取决于节点间传输方式、可用带宽和并发传输负载。"

msgid "The first instance still needs to load the model normally. RFork accelerates subsequent compatible instances; it is not a replacement for the initial checkpoint load."
msgstr "第一个实例仍需正常加载模型。RFork 用于加速后续兼容实例，不能替代首次检查点加载。"

msgid "At cluster scale, this turns running vLLM Ascend replicas into a distributed pool of NPU-resident weight sources. An instance provides inference compute while also making its already-materialized tensors available to later replicas."
msgstr "在集群层面，运行中的 vLLM Ascend 副本会组成一个分布式 NPU 驻留权重池。实例在提供推理计算的同时，也能将已具现化的张量提供给后续副本。"

msgid "### Default Loader vs. RFork"
msgstr "### 默认加载器与 RFork 对比"

msgid "| Characteristic | Default loader | RFork |"
msgstr "| 特性 | 默认加载器 | RFork |"

msgid "| Weight source | Model storage | Running seed instance |"
msgstr "| 权重来源 | 模型存储 | 运行中的 seed 实例 |"

msgid "| Destination path | Storage and host staging before reaching NPU memory | TransferEngine reads into pre-allocated NPU buffers |"
msgstr "| 目标端路径 | 经过存储和主机侧暂存后进入 NPU 内存 | TransferEngine 读入预先分配的 NPU 缓冲区 |"

msgid "| Additional dependency | None beyond the normal model-loading stack | YuanRong TransferEngine and an RFork planner |"
msgstr "| 额外依赖 | 常规模型加载栈之外无额外依赖 | YuanRong TransferEngine 和 RFork 规划器 |"

msgid "| Setup overhead | Storage access and checkpoint deserialization | NPU memory registration and seed discovery |"
msgstr "| 初始化开销 | 存储访问和检查点反序列化 | NPU 内存注册和 seed 发现 |"

msgid "| Repeated scale-out | Every instance reads the checkpoint | Compatible instances reuse an existing seed |"
msgstr "| 重复扩容 | 每个实例都读取检查点 | 兼容实例复用现有 seed |"

msgid "| Failure behavior | Loading fails if the checkpoint path is unavailable | RFork cleans up and falls back to the default loader |"
msgstr "| 失败行为 | 检查点路径不可用时加载失败 | RFork 清理状态并回退到默认加载器 |"

msgid "RFork is most useful when the same model and parallel configuration are started repeatedly. For a single cold start, memory registration and planner coordination add work without an existing seed to reuse."
msgstr "在相同模型和并行配置需要重复启动时，RFork 最有价值。对于单次冷启动，由于没有可复用的 seed，内存注册和规划器协调反而会增加额外工作。"

msgid "## Architecture"
msgstr "## 架构"

msgid "RFork consists of four cooperating components:"
msgstr "RFork 由四个协同组件构成："

msgid "- **Planner**: Tracks seed identity, deployment topology, health, and transfer leases, then selects a compatible seed for each destination."
msgstr "- **规划器**：跟踪 seed 标识、部署拓扑、健康状态和传输租约，并为每个目标端选择兼容的 seed。"

msgid "- **Seed instance**: An initialized vLLM Ascend instance that registers its live NPU weight buffers and publishes TransferEngine metadata."
msgstr "- **Seed 实例**：已完成初始化的 vLLM Ascend 实例，负责注册当前使用的 NPU 权重缓冲区并发布 TransferEngine 元数据。"

msgid "- **Destination instance**: A new vLLM Ascend instance that creates the matching tensor layout and pulls weights into its local NPU buffers."
msgstr "- **目标实例**：新的 vLLM Ascend 实例，负责创建匹配的张量布局并将权重拉取到本地 NPU 缓冲区。"

msgid "- **YuanRong TransferEngine**: Manages registered memory and performs batched reads between the seed and destination."
msgstr "- **YuanRong TransferEngine**：管理已注册内存，并在 seed 与目标端之间执行批量读取。"

msgid "### End-to-End Workflow"
msgstr "### 端到端工作流程"

msgid "The RFork loading flow is:"
msgstr "RFork 加载流程如下："

msgid "1. vLLM starts with `--load-format rfork`."
msgstr "1. 使用 `--load-format rfork` 启动 vLLM。"

msgid "2. RFork builds a **seed key** from the model identity and deployment topology."
msgstr "2. RFork 根据模型标识和部署拓扑构建 **seed key**。"

msgid "3. RFork initializes the local model and prepares/synchronizes any required processed tensor layout, then asks the planner for a seed matching that key."
msgstr "3. RFork 初始化本地模型并完成必要的张量布局准备和同步，然后向规划器请求与该 key 匹配的 seed。"

msgid "4. If a seed is returned, the new instance registers local weight memory, fetches the remote transfer-engine metadata from the seed, and performs batch weight transfer into local parameter buffers."
msgstr "4. 如果规划器返回 seed，新实例会注册本地权重内存、从 seed 获取远端 TransferEngine 元数据，并将权重批量传输到本地参数缓冲区。"

msgid "5. If no seed is available, or any step fails, RFork cleans up and falls back to the default loader."
msgstr "5. 如果没有可用 seed，或任一步骤失败，RFork 会清理状态并回退到默认加载器。"

msgid "6. After the instance finishes loading, it starts a local seed service and periodically reports heartbeat to the planner, so later instances can reuse it."
msgstr "6. 实例完成加载后会启动本地 seed 服务，并定期向规划器上报心跳，以供后续实例复用。"

msgid "TransferEngine metadata is exchanged through the seed HTTP service, while tensor contents are transferred through TransferEngine. Each worker owns its own TransferEngine session and listening port, so corresponding parallel ranks transfer their local weight shards independently."
msgstr "TransferEngine 元数据通过 seed HTTP 服务交换，张量内容则通过 TransferEngine 传输。每个 worker 都拥有独立的 TransferEngine 会话和监听端口，因此对应的并行 rank 会分别传输各自的本地权重分片。"

msgid "### Seed-Side Initialization"
msgstr "### Seed 端初始化"

msgid "After a vLLM Ascend instance finishes loading its model, each RFork worker prepares the tensors that another instance may read:"
msgstr "vLLM Ascend 实例完成模型加载后，每个 RFork worker 都会准备可供其他实例读取的张量："

msgid "1. RFork prepares the transferable Ascend tensor layout and enumerates the live model tensors."
msgstr "1. RFork 准备可传输的 Ascend 张量布局，并枚举当前有效的模型张量。"

msgid "2. Logical tensor ranges are associated with their backing NPU allocations. Overlapping logical ranges that share one allocation are registered without registering the same backing memory repeatedly."
msgstr "2. 将逻辑张量范围与其底层 NPU 内存分配关联起来。共享同一内存分配的重叠逻辑范围不会重复注册相同的底层内存。"

msgid "3. Registration requests are split into bounded batches before being submitted to YuanRong TransferEngine."
msgstr "3. 注册请求会拆分为大小受限的批次，再提交给 YuanRong TransferEngine。"

msgid "4. The worker publishes its TransferEngine session, tensor addresses, element sizes, and shapes through the local seed service."
msgstr "4. Worker 通过本地 seed 服务发布 TransferEngine 会话、张量地址、元素大小和 shape。"

msgid "5. A heartbeat advertises the seed key, address, port, and rank to the planner."
msgstr "5. 心跳会向规划器上报 seed key、地址、端口和 rank。"

msgid "The seed remains a normal serving instance. RFork does not ask it to reread the checkpoint or run a model-weight broadcast. Transfers can still consume inter-node and NPU-memory bandwidth, so production deployments should control concurrent readers and observe inference latency."
msgstr "Seed 仍是正常提供服务的实例。RFork 不会要求它重新读取检查点或执行模型权重广播。传输仍可能占用节点间带宽和 NPU 内存带宽，因此生产部署应限制并发读取方数量并观察推理时延。"

msgid "### Destination-Side Loading"
msgstr "### 目标端加载"

msgid "The destination performs the following steps for each worker rank:"
msgstr "目标端为每个 worker rank 执行以下步骤："

msgid "1. Build the destination model structure and allocate the final NPU tensor layout."
msgstr "1. 构建目标端模型结构并分配最终的 NPU 张量布局。"

msgid "2. After required layout preparation and synchronization, acquire a seed lease and register the destination tensor ranges with its local TransferEngine session."
msgstr "2. 完成必要的布局准备和同步后，获取 seed 租约并使用本地 TransferEngine 会话注册目标端张量范围。"

msgid "3. Fetch the matching seed worker's session and tensor manifest over HTTP."
msgstr "3. 通过 HTTP 获取匹配 seed worker 的会话和张量清单。"

msgid "4. Verify tensor names, element counts, element sizes, and shapes before transferring data."
msgstr "4. 传输前校验张量名称、元素数量、元素大小和 shape。"

msgid "5. Group tensors into bounded chunks and use batched synchronous reads to copy them into the destination buffers."
msgstr "5. 将张量划分为大小受限的分块，并通过批量同步读取复制到目标缓冲区。"

msgid "6. Schedule bounded asynchronous lease release after the transfer, whether it succeeds or falls back."
msgstr "6. 无论传输成功还是触发回退，传输结束后都会调度重试次数有限的异步租约释放。"

msgid "Once loading completes, the destination can publish itself as another seed. A deployment can therefore grow from one storage-loaded instance into a pool of reusable NPU-resident weight sources."
msgstr "加载完成后，目标端也可以将自身发布为新的 seed。因此，一个部署可以从单个通过存储加载的实例扩展为可复用的 NPU 驻留权重源池。"

msgid "### Registration and Shutdown Lifecycle"
msgstr "### 注册与关停生命周期"

msgid "Registered NPU memory must remain valid while remote readers may still hold leases. RFork therefore keeps Python tensor owners and TransferEngine registration state alive until unregistration or finalization succeeds."
msgstr "远端读取方仍可能持有租约时，已注册的 NPU 内存必须保持有效。因此，在注销或终结成功之前，RFork 会一直保留 Python 张量所有者和 TransferEngine 注册状态。"

msgid "During worker shutdown, RFork first stops advertising the seed, terminates the heartbeat, and closes the local seed service. It then finalizes TransferEngine. If remote reads are still active, finalization retries `ErrorCode.kNotReady` with a bounded delay. If the seed service cannot stop or finalization does not complete within the retry limit, RFork retains the registration state rather than releasing memory that may still be referenced."
msgstr "Worker 关停时，RFork 会先停止发布 seed、终止心跳并关闭本地 seed 服务，然后终结 TransferEngine。如果远端读取仍在进行，终结操作会以有限次数和间隔重试 `ErrorCode.kNotReady`。如果 seed 服务无法停止，或终结操作在重试上限内仍未完成，RFork 会保留注册状态，而不会释放可能仍被引用的内存。"

msgid "rfork flowchart"
msgstr "RFork 流程图"

msgid "- **Scale-out after a first successful load**: The first instance may still load from storage, but later instances with the same deployment identity can reuse it as a seed and shorten startup time."
msgstr "- **首次成功加载后的横向扩容**：第一个实例仍可从存储加载，但具有相同部署标识的后续实例可以将其作为 seed 复用，从而缩短启动时间。"

msgid "- **Elastic serving clusters**: Because RFork asks a planner for available seeds, it fits clusters where instances are created and reclaimed dynamically."
msgstr "- **弹性服务集群**：RFork 会向规划器请求可用 seed，因此适用于动态创建和回收实例的集群。"

msgid "- **Topology-sensitive deployments**: RFork encodes `kv_role`, `node_rank`, optional `pp_rank`, `tp_rank`, optional `ep_rank`, and optional `draft` role into the seed key, so only topology-compatible instances are matched together."
msgstr "- **拓扑敏感部署**：RFork 会将 `kv_role`、`node_rank`、可选的 `pp_rank`、`tp_rank`、可选的 `ep_rank` 和可选的 `draft` 角色编码到 seed key 中，因此只会匹配拓扑兼容的实例。"

msgid "## Usage"
msgstr "## 使用方法"

msgid "To enable RFork, pass `--load-format rfork` and provide RFork settings through `--model-loader-extra-config` as a JSON string."
msgstr "要启用 RFork，请传入 `--load-format rfork`，并通过 `--model-loader-extra-config` 以 JSON 字符串形式提供 RFork 配置。"

msgid "### RFork Prerequisites"
msgstr "### RFork 前提条件"

msgid "- Install `YuanRong TransferEngine` on every RFork instance."
msgstr "- 在每个 RFork 实例上安装 `YuanRong TransferEngine`。"

msgid "- Run a planner service that implements the RFork seed protocol. A simple mock planner script is provided at [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)."
msgstr "- 运行实现 RFork seed 协议的规划器服务。项目在 [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py) 中提供了一个简单的模拟规划器脚本。"

msgid "### Configuration Fields"
msgstr "### 配置字段"

msgid "| **rfork_seed_key_separator** | String | Separator used when building the RFork seed key string. | Optional. Default: `$`. Keep the same value across compatible instances. |"
msgstr "| **rfork_seed_key_separator** | 字符串 | 构建 RFork seed key 字符串时使用的分隔符。 | 可选。默认值：`$`。兼容实例之间必须保持一致。 |"

msgid "### How RFork Matches Seeds"
msgstr "### RFork 如何匹配 Seed"

msgid ""
"RFork does not match instances by `model_url` alone. The seed identity is "
"composed from:"
msgstr "RFork 不单独通过 `model_url` 匹配实例。种子身份由以下部分组成："

msgid ""
"- `model_url`\n"
"- `model_deploy_strategy_name`\n"
"- `pp_rank` when pipeline parallel size is greater than 1\n"
"- `tp_rank`\n"
"- `ep_rank` when expert parallelism is enabled for an MoE model\n"
"- `draft` role when the worker runs as a draft model"
msgstr ""
"- `model_url`\n"
"- `model_deploy_strategy_name`\n"
"- 当流水线并行大小大于 1 时的 `pp_rank`\n"
"- `tp_rank`\n"
"- 当 MoE 模型启用专家并行时的 `ep_rank`\n"
"- 当工作器作为草稿模型运行时的 `draft` 角色"

msgid "### Quantized Models"
msgstr "### 量化模型"

msgid "For quantized models, RFork transfers tensors after Ascend weight post-processing instead of raw checkpoint parameters. The receiver first builds the same post-load tensor layout as the seed, then RFork copies the live NPU tensors used by inference."
msgstr "对于量化模型，RFork 传输 Ascend 权重后处理后的张量，而不是原始检查点参数。接收端会先构建与 seed 相同的加载后张量布局，再由 RFork 复制推理实际使用的 NPU 张量。"

msgid "This path handles Ascend quantization changes such as weight transposition, NZ format conversion, packed weights, derived scale tensors, and MLA/SFA runtime tensors such as `W_UV` and `W_UK_T`. Empty tensors that were released during post-processing are not included in the transfer manifest."
msgstr "该路径支持 Ascend 量化过程中的权重转置、NZ 格式转换、打包权重、派生 scale 张量，以及 `W_UV`、`W_UK_T` 等 MLA/SFA 运行时张量。后处理期间已经释放的空张量不会包含在传输清单中。"

msgid "When validating RFork for a quantized model:"
msgstr "为量化模型验证 RFork 时："

msgid "## Tested Models"
msgstr "## 已测试模型"

msgid "- Use a new `model_deploy_strategy_name` after changing model arguments or RFork code, so the planner does not match a receiver with an incompatible old seed."
msgstr "- 修改模型参数或 RFork 代码后，应使用新的 `model_deploy_strategy_name`，避免规划器将接收端与不兼容的旧 seed 匹配。"

msgid "- A successful RFork transfer logs `transfer weights starts` and `transfer weights time`. The fallback path logs `RFork transfer failed`."
msgstr "- RFork 传输成功时会记录 `transfer weights starts` 和 `transfer weights time`；回退路径会记录 `RFork transfer failed`。"

msgid "## Supported Models"
msgstr "## 支持的模型"

msgid "Mainstream DeepSeek/Qwen/GLM series are supported."
msgstr "支持主流的 DeepSeek/Qwen/GLM 系列模型。"

msgid "## Performance Considerations"
msgstr "## 性能注意事项"

msgid "RFork indexes tensor intervals for allocator-block lookup and uses binary search to verify backing-memory coverage before registration. New seed services return weight and shape metadata together in one HTTP response; receivers retain the two-request path for older seed services that omit inline shape metadata."
msgstr "RFork 为张量区间建立索引以查找 allocator 内存块，并在注册前通过二分查找验证底层内存的完整覆盖。新 seed 服务在同一个 HTTP 响应中返回权重和 shape 元数据；对于未内联 shape 元数据的旧 seed 服务，接收端保留两次请求的兼容路径。"

msgid "RFork performance depends on model size, parallelism, NPU memory layout, TransferEngine registration time, inter-node bandwidth, and the number of concurrent destinations."
msgstr "RFork 性能取决于模型大小、并行配置、NPU 内存布局、TransferEngine 注册时间、节点间带宽和并发目标端数量。"

msgid "For an NPU deployment, compare RFork with the default loader using at least these metrics:"
msgstr "在 NPU 部署中对比 RFork 与默认加载器时，至少应关注以下指标："

msgid "- time from process start until the service becomes ready;"
msgstr "- 从进程启动到服务就绪的时间；"

msgid "- `transfer weights time` and transferred bytes reported in the vLLM logs;"
msgstr "- vLLM 日志中记录的 `transfer weights time` 和传输字节数；"

msgid "- storage and host-memory traffic during startup;"
msgstr "- 启动期间的存储和主机内存流量；"

msgid "- seed-instance inference latency while transfers are active;"
msgstr "- 传输进行期间 seed 实例的推理时延；"

msgid "- seed hit rate, transfer failure rate, and fallback rate."
msgstr "- Seed 命中率、传输失败率和回退率。"

msgid "Memory registration adds setup cost to the seed. Its benefit is realized when later replicas reuse that registration, so tests should include repeated scale-out rather than only a single cold start."
msgstr "内存注册会增加 seed 的初始化开销，其收益要在后续副本复用注册时才能体现。因此，测试应包含重复横向扩容，而不应只测试一次冷启动。"

msgid "## Example Commands & Placeholders"
msgstr "## 示例命令与占位符"

msgid "> Replace parts in `<...>` before running."
msgstr "> 运行前请替换 `<...>` 中的内容。"

msgid "### 1. Install YuanRong TransferEngine"
msgstr "### 1. 安装 YuanRong TransferEngine"

msgid "### 2. Start the Planner"
msgstr "### 2. 启动规划器"

msgid "A simple planner implementation is provided at [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)."
msgstr "项目在 [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py) 中提供了一个简单的规划器实现。"

msgid "### 3. Start vLLM Instances"
msgstr "### 3. 启动 vLLM 实例"

msgid "Use the same RFork startup command for both the first instance and later instances in the same deployment."
msgstr "同一部署中的第一个实例和后续实例使用相同的 RFork 启动命令。"

msgid "For the first instance, the planner usually has no compatible seed yet, so RFork falls back to the default loader. After loading finishes, that instance starts its local seed service and reports itself to the planner."
msgstr "启动第一个实例时，规划器通常还没有兼容的 seed，因此 RFork 会回退到默认加载器。加载完成后，该实例会启动本地 seed 服务并向规划器上报自身。"

msgid "For later instances, if the planner can allocate a compatible seed, RFork will try to transfer weights from the existing seed instance before falling back to the default loader."
msgstr "对于后续实例，如果规划器能够分配兼容的 seed，RFork 会优先尝试从现有 seed 实例传输权重；失败时再回退到默认加载器。"

msgid "### Placeholder Descriptions"
msgstr "### 占位符说明"

msgid "- `<model_path>`: Model path or model identifier passed to `vllm serve`."
msgstr "- `<model_path>`：传递给 `vllm serve` 的模型路径或模型标识。"

msgid "- `<served_model_name>`: Service name exposed by vLLM."
msgstr "- `<served_model_name>`：vLLM 对外暴露的服务名称。"

msgid "- `<planner_ip>`: IP address or hostname of the RFork planner."
msgstr "- `<planner_ip>`：RFork 规划器的 IP 地址或主机名。"

msgid "- `<planner_port>`: Listening port of the RFork planner."
msgstr "- `<planner_port>`：RFork 规划器的监听端口。"

msgid "- `<model_url>`: Stable model identity string used to build the RFork seed key."
msgstr "- `<model_url>`：用于构建 RFork seed key 的稳定模型标识字符串。"

msgid "- `<deploy_strategy>`: Stable deployment-strategy name used to build the RFork seed key."
msgstr "- `<deploy_strategy>`：用于构建 RFork seed key 的稳定部署策略名称。"

msgid "- `<port>`: Serving port of the vLLM instance being started."
msgstr "- `<port>`：待启动 vLLM 实例的服务端口。"

msgid "## Note & Caveats"
msgstr "## 注意事项"

msgid "## Overview"
msgstr "## 概述"

msgid "- RFork weight transfer does not support dynamic EPLB because expert weights and placement can change after the seed service starts. If `eplb_config.dynamic_eplb` or `eplb_config.expert_map_record_path` enables dynamic EPLB, RFork transfer is bypassed and the model is loaded through the default model loader."
msgstr "- RFork 权重传输不支持动态 EPLB，因为 seed 服务启动后，专家权重和放置位置可能发生变化。如果通过 `eplb_config.dynamic_eplb` 或 `eplb_config.expert_map_record_path` 启用动态 EPLB，系统会跳过 RFork 传输并使用默认模型加载器。"

msgid "The RFork loading flow in the current implementation is:"
msgstr "当前实现中的 RFork 加载流程如下："

msgid "## Flowchart"
msgstr "## 流程图"

msgid "## Application Scenarios"
msgstr "## 应用场景"

msgid ""
"- **Scale-out after a first successful load**: The first instance may still load from storage, but later instances with the same deployment identity can reuse it as a seed and shorten startup time.\n"
"- **Elastic serving clusters**: Because RFork asks a planner for available seeds, it fits clusters where instances are created and reclaimed dynamically.\n"
"- **Topology-sensitive deployments**: RFork encodes optional `pp_rank`, `tp_rank`, and optional `ep_rank` into the seed key, so only shard-compatible instances are matched together. The `kv_role` and the physical node are deliberately excluded, so prefill and decode instances on different nodes can share seeds."
msgstr ""
"- **首次成功加载后的横向扩展**：第一个实例可能仍从存储加载，但后续具有相同部署标识的实例可以将其作为种子实例复用，从而缩短启动时间。\n"
"- **弹性服务集群**：由于 RFork 向调度器请求可用种子实例，因此适用于实例动态创建和回收的集群。\n"
"- **拓扑敏感的部署**：RFork 将可选的 `pp_rank`、`tp_rank` 以及可选的 `ep_rank` 编码到种子键中，因此只有分片兼容的实例才会被匹配在一起。`kv_role` 和物理节点被有意排除，因此不同节点上的 prefill 和 decode 实例可以共享种子。"

