msgid "RFork manages its environment fallbacks in its own `RForkConfig` configuration module:"
msgstr "RFork 在自身的 `RForkConfig` 配置模块中管理环境变量回退："

msgid "Each worker uses an `RForkSession` to own the planner lease, registered tensors, seed HTTP service, and heartbeat. The session coordinates fallback cleanup and finalizes TransferEngine only after the seed service stops and the outgoing lease is released. Configuration, manifest validation, and HTTP clients are separate RFork modules; startup arguments and environment variable names remain unchanged."
msgstr "每个 worker 使用 `RForkSession` 管理规划器租约、已注册张量、seed HTTP 服务和心跳。Session 协调回退清理，仅在 seed 服务停止且所持租约释放后终结 TransferEngine。配置、manifest 校验和 HTTP 客户端拆分为独立的 RFork 模块；启动参数和环境变量名称保持不变。"

msgid "| Environment variable | Default | Notes |"
msgstr "| 环境变量 | 默认值 | 备注 |"

msgid "| `MODEL_URL` | unset | |"
msgstr "| `MODEL_URL` | 未设置 | |"

msgid "| `MODEL_DEPLOY_STRATEGY_NAME` | unset | |"
msgstr "| `MODEL_DEPLOY_STRATEGY_NAME` | 未设置 | |"

msgid "| `RFORK_SCHEDULER_URL` | unset | |"
msgstr "| `RFORK_SCHEDULER_URL` | 未设置 | |"

msgid "| `RFORK_SEED_TIMEOUT_SEC` | `5.0` | Finite and positive only. |"
msgstr "| `RFORK_SEED_TIMEOUT_SEC` | `5.0` | 仅允许有限的正值。 |"

msgid "| `RFORK_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SEC` | `10.0` | Finite and positive only. |"
msgstr "| `RFORK_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SEC` | `10.0` | 仅允许有限的正值。 |"

msgid "| `RFORK_SEED_BIND_HOST` | `0.0.0.0` | |"
msgstr "| `RFORK_SEED_BIND_HOST` | `0.0.0.0` | |"

msgid "| `RFORK_SEED_ADVERTISE_HOST` | auto-detect | |"
msgstr "| `RFORK_SEED_ADVERTISE_HOST` | 自动检测 | |"

msgid ""
"`model_loader_extra_config` takes precedence over environment values for fields\n"
"that support environment fallbacks. Numeric values reject booleans, NaN,\n"
"infinity, and non-positive values. The three operational fields above are\n"
"JSON-only; invalid explicit values raise `ValueError` rather than using an\n"
"environment fallback."
msgstr ""
"`model_loader_extra_config` 对支持环境变量回退的字段优先于环境变量。数值配置拒绝布尔值、NaN、无穷大和非正数。"
"上述三个操作字段仅支持 JSON；显式无效值会抛出 `ValueError`，不会使用环境变量回退。"

msgid ""
"Heartbeat scheduling waits `rfork_heartbeat_interval_sec` after each heartbeat\n"
"request completes (default: `30.0`); it is not a fixed-rate interval. Seed\n"
"heartbeats report health and do not renew leases. The lease-release fields\n"
"affect lease release only; the public synchronous release helper uses the same\n"
"configured max-attempt and retry-interval values. Client-side seed deregistration\n"
"(`remove_seed`) keeps its internal retry policy of three attempts with\n"
"`0.1`-second linear backoff."
msgstr ""
"心跳调度会在每次心跳请求完成后等待 `rfork_heartbeat_interval_sec`（默认值：`30.0`），而不是采用固定速率间隔。"
"种子心跳用于上报健康状态，不会续租。租约释放字段仅影响租约释放；公开的同步释放辅助函数使用相同的已配置最大尝试次数和重试间隔值。"
"客户端种子注销（`remove_seed`）仍使用内部重试策略：尝试三次，采用 `0.1` 秒线性退避。"

msgid ""
"The parallel ranks keep seed and receiver on the same model shard, while the\n"
"disaggregation role (`kv_role`) and the physical node are deliberately excluded\n"
"so prefill and decode instances on different nodes can share seeds."
msgstr ""
"并行秩保证种子和接收方位于同一模型分片，而分离角色（`kv_role`）和物理节点被有意排除，因此不同节点上的 prefill "
"和 decode 实例可以共享种子。"

msgid ""
"The identity is anchored by a SHA256 compatibility fingerprint covering model\n"
"revision, dtype, quantization method, a digest of the full quantization config,\n"
"model architecture, tensor/pipeline/expert parallel world sizes, Ascend NZ\n"
"layout mode, and hardware layout policy. This prevents an old or differently\n"
"configured seed from being selected merely because its textual key happens to\n"
"match."
msgstr ""
"该身份由 SHA256 兼容性指纹锚定，涵盖模型修订版本、数据类型、量化方式、完整量化配置的摘要、模型架构、张量/流水线/"
"专家并行规模、Ascend NZ 布局模式和硬件布局策略。这样可防止旧种子或配置不同的种子仅因文本键碰巧相同而被选中。"

msgid ""
"Two instances must agree on model identity and parallel layout before the "
"planner will treat them as interchangeable seeds. The seed key is an opaque "
"SHA256 digest, so seed and receiver instances must run the same RFork "
"protocol to derive the same key."
msgstr ""
"两个实例必须在模型身份和并行布局上达成一致，规划器才会将它们视为可互换种子。种子键是不透明的 SHA256 "
"摘要，因此种子实例和接收实例必须运行相同的 RFork 协议才能推导出相同的键。"

msgid "### Planner Responsibilities"
msgstr "### 规划器职责"

msgid "Lease release runs asynchronously after transfer. Planner release requests never hold the session lock. The client makes at most `rfork_lease_release_max_attempts` release attempts per lease (default: `3`, including the initial request), waiting `rfork_lease_release_retry_interval_sec` seconds (default: `30.0`) between transient failures (network errors, HTTP 408/429, or 5xx). These settings affect lease release only. Other rejected responses stop immediately even when attempts remain; HTTP 200 and 404 retain their existing acknowledgement semantics. The public synchronous release helper uses the same configured max-attempt and retry-interval values. Failed releases do not reload valid weights or prevent model loading from continuing, but the worker is not advertised as a new seed until release is acknowledged. After retry exhaustion, the unresolved lease remains recorded and requires planner-side investigation/recovery. Shutdown does not wait for release I/O and retains TransferEngine resources if release is unresolved."
msgstr "租约释放在传输完成后异步执行。规划器释放请求不会持有 session 锁。客户端对每个租约最多执行 `rfork_lease_release_max_attempts` 次释放尝试（默认值：`3`，包括初始请求），在可重试故障（网络错误、HTTP 408/429 或 5xx）之间等待 `rfork_lease_release_retry_interval_sec` 秒（默认值：`30.0`）。这些设置仅影响租约释放。即使仍有剩余次数，其他被拒绝的响应也会立即停止；HTTP 200 和 404 继续沿用现有确认语义。公开的同步释放辅助函数使用相同的已配置最大尝试次数和重试间隔值。释放失败不会重新加载有效权重，也不会阻止模型继续加载，但在释放得到确认前，worker 不会作为新的 seed 上报。重试耗尽后，未解决的租约仍会被记录，需要规划器侧调查/恢复。关闭过程不会等待释放 I/O；如果释放未解决，仍会保留 TransferEngine 资源。"

msgid "The example planner reclaims abandoned leases after 60 seconds by default, independently of seed heartbeat expiry. Configure a positive integer duration with `--lease-ttl-sec` or `RFORK_MOCK_LEASE_TTL_SEC`; an explicit CLI value takes precedence over a valid environment value. The loader acquires its lease after model initialization and any required layout preparation/synchronization. Size the timeout for memory registration, metadata fetch, transfer and asynchronous release, including retry delays. Initialization and layout timings are logged separately. Seed heartbeats do not renew leases. Expired leases return 404 on release, which the current client accepts as already released; successful startup alone does not prove that the lease remained valid throughout transfer."
msgstr "示例规划器默认在 60 秒后回收遗留租约，此机制独立于 seed 心跳过期。可通过 `--lease-ttl-sec` 或 `RFORK_MOCK_LEASE_TTL_SEC` 设置正整数秒数；显式 CLI 值优先于有效的环境变量值。加载器在模型初始化及必要的布局准备和同步完成后才获取租约。超时应覆盖内存注册、元数据获取、传输及异步释放，包括重试等待。初始化和布局处理耗时分别记录。Seed 心跳不会续租。过期租约释放时返回 404，当前客户端将其视为已经释放；启动成功并不证明租约在整个传输期间都有效。"

msgid "If no seed is available after preparation, the loader discards the prepared model and loads from the checkpoint. This adds preparation cost to a seed miss. Before fallback, it restores the pre-attempt compilation registries and rotary cache so shared main/draft state is preserved. Model construction and rollback in a worker are assumed to be serialized. Lease renewal is not enabled: it requires explicit support from both planner and client."
msgstr "准备完成后如果没有可用 seed，加载器会丢弃已准备的模型并从检查点加载，因此 seed 未命中会增加准备成本。回退前会恢复本次尝试之前的编译注册表和旋转位置编码缓存，保留 main/draft 共享状态。此逻辑假设同一 worker 内的模型构造和回退串行执行。当前未启用租约续租，因为这需要规划器和客户端双方明确支持。"

msgid "After an instance becomes ready, each worker periodically reports its seed metadata to the planner. A new instance asks the planner for a seed with the same seed key; the planner selects one with available capacity and returns a lease. A missing or unhealthy seed is not fatal because the destination can use the default loader and later join the seed pool itself."
msgstr "实例就绪后，每个 worker 会定期向规划器上报 seed 元数据。新实例使用相同的 seed key 向规划器请求 seed；规划器选择仍有可用容量的 seed 并返回租约。缺失或不健康的 seed 不会导致致命错误，因为目标实例可以改用默认加载器，并在随后自行加入 seed 池。"

msgid "The bundled planner demonstrates this workflow, but it is a functional example rather than a production scheduler. A production planner should provide:"
msgstr "随附的规划器演示了这一流程，但它只是功能示例，而不是生产级调度器。生产环境中的规划器应提供："

msgid "- compatibility matching based on model identity and parallel deployment topology;"
msgstr "- 基于模型身份和并行部署拓扑进行兼容性匹配；"

msgid "- heartbeat-based health tracking and stale-seed removal;"
msgstr "- 基于心跳的健康状态跟踪和过期 seed 清理；"

msgid "- capacity and lease accounting so one seed is not overloaded by concurrent destinations;"
msgstr "- 容量与租约核算，避免单个 seed 被并发目标实例压垮；"

msgid "- reliable lease release when a transfer completes or fails;"
msgstr "- 在传输完成或失败时可靠地释放租约；"

msgid "- observability for seed selection, transfer failures, and fallback frequency."
msgstr "- 针对 seed 选择、传输失败和回退频率的可观测性。"

msgid ""
"- Apply the same vLLM Ascend code to both the seed instance and the receiver instance.\n"
"- Restart the planner and all vLLM instances after changing RFork code, because existing seeds keep their old transfer metadata.\n"
"- Use a new `model_deploy_strategy_name` after changing model arguments or RFork code when operating with an older planner; compatibility fingerprints also reject incompatible old seeds before native transfer.\n"
"- A successful RFork transfer logs `transfer weights starts` and `transfer weights time`. The fallback path logs `RFork transfer failed`."
msgstr ""
"- 在种子实例和接收实例上使用相同的 vLLM Ascend 代码。\n"
"- 修改 RFork 代码后重启规划器和所有 vLLM 实例，因为已有种子仍保留旧的传输元数据。\n"
"- 在修改模型参数或 RFork 代码后、与较旧规划器协同运行时，使用新的 `model_deploy_strategy_name`；兼容性指纹也会在原生传输前拒绝不兼容的旧种子。\n"
"- RFork 传输成功时会记录 `transfer weights starts` 和 `transfer weights time`；回退路径会记录 `RFork transfer failed`。"

msgid ""
"- RFork requires `MemoryRegistration`, `ErrorCode.kNotReady`, `batch_register_memory_ex()`, and `finalize()` from `YuanRong TransferEngine`. Packages without these APIs cannot initialize the transfer backend; RFork falls back to the default loader and does not start a seed service.\n"
"- If RFork is used, **each worker process** must bind a listening port. The seed bind host is configurable and the port is assigned randomly.\n"
"- RFork currently requires all materialized model parameters and registered buffers to reside on NPU. Mixed CPU/NPU or CPU-offloaded model state is rejected and falls back to the default loader rather than performing a partial transfer.\n"
"- Keep the seed bind/advertise addresses reachable from the receiver workers. Transport encryption and access control remain the deployment's responsibility, so use HTTPS and network isolation for untrusted networks.\n"
"- RFork weight transfer does not support dynamic EPLB because expert weights and placement can change after the seed service starts. If `eplb_config.dynamic_eplb` or `eplb_config.expert_map_record_path` enables dynamic EPLB, RFork transfer is bypassed and the model is loaded through the default model loader.\n"
"- The example [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py) is only a simple mock implementation. If you need stronger scheduling, capacity management, or production-grade availability behavior, implement your own planner based on the RFork seed protocol."
msgstr ""
"- RFork 需要 `YuanRong TransferEngine` 提供 `MemoryRegistration`、`ErrorCode.kNotReady`、`batch_register_memory_ex()` 和 `finalize()`。不包含这些 API 的软件包无法初始化传输后端；RFork 会回退到默认加载器，且不会启动 seed 服务。\n"
"- 使用 RFork 时，**每个 worker 进程**都必须绑定一个监听端口。种子绑定地址可配置，端口随机分配。\n"
"- RFork 当前要求所有已实体化的模型参数和已注册缓冲区都位于 NPU。混合 CPU/NPU 或 CPU 卸载的模型状态会被拒绝并回退到默认加载器，避免执行不完整传输。\n"
"- 请确保接收 worker 可以访问种子的绑定和上报地址。传输加密与访问控制由部署环境负责，因此在不可信网络中应使用 HTTPS 和网络隔离。\n"
"- RFork 权重传输不支持动态 EPLB，因为种子服务启动后专家权重和放置位置可能发生变化。如果 `eplb_config.dynamic_eplb` 或 `eplb_config.expert_map_record_path` 启用动态 EPLB，RFork 会跳过传输并使用默认模型加载器。\n"
"- 示例 [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py) 只是简单的模拟实现。如需更强的调度、容量管理或生产级可用性行为，请基于 RFork 种子协议实现自己的规划器。"


msgid "Dashed arrows show **Planner coordination**, thin arrows show **Seed HTTP metadata exchange**, and the thick arrow shows **TransferEngine weight data**. The destination requests the seed's transfer session, tensor addresses, and shapes over HTTP, then initiates batch reads from Seed NPU memory into its local NPU buffers. The Planner and Seed HTTP service do not carry tensor contents."
msgstr "虚线箭头表示 **Planner 调度协调**，细实线箭头表示 **Seed HTTP 元数据交换**，粗实线箭头表示 **TransferEngine 权重数据传输**。目标端通过 HTTP 请求 seed 的传输会话、张量地址和形状，再发起批量读取，将 Seed NPU 内存中的权重读入本地 NPU 缓冲区。Planner 和 Seed HTTP 服务均不传输张量内容。"

msgid "The diagram shows one matching rank pair. Each destination worker independently acquires a seed for its TP/PP/EP shard identity and transfers that shard into its own NPU buffers. Different destination ranks may select corresponding seed workers from different instances. After loading and releasing its source lease, a destination can advertise itself as another seed."
msgstr "图中展示一对匹配的 rank。每个目标端 worker 根据自身 TP/PP/EP 分片身份独立申请 seed，并将对应分片传输到自己的 NPU 缓冲区。不同目标端 rank 可以从不同实例中选择对应的 seed worker。加载完成并释放源端租约后，目标端也可以将自身发布为新的 seed。"

msgid "5. If no seed is available, or any transfer step fails, RFork cleans up and falls back to the default loader."
msgstr "5. 如果没有可用 seed，或任一传输步骤失败，RFork 会清理状态并回退到默认加载器。"

msgid "6. After a successful transfer, RFork schedules asynchronous source-lease release, completes any remaining post-load processing, and switches the model to evaluation mode. It then starts a local seed service and advertises it to the planner when the source lease has been released. A seed-service startup failure retains the loaded model and cleans up Seed resources as far as safely possible."
msgstr "6. 传输成功后，RFork 会调度异步源端租约释放，完成剩余的加载后处理，并将模型切换为评估模式。源端租约释放后，再启动本地 seed 服务并向 Planner 上报。Seed 服务启动失败时会保留已加载模型，并在安全允许的范围内清理 Seed 资源。"

msgid "Model initialization and required layout preparation happen **before lease acquisition**, keeping the lease focused on registration, metadata exchange, and transfer. Session setup, initialization, layout, or post-load errors also use the fallback cleanup path. If the default loader itself fails, model loading fails."
msgstr "模型初始化和必要的布局准备发生在**申请租约之前**，使租约主要覆盖内存注册、元数据交换和权重传输。会话创建、初始化、布局处理或加载后处理发生错误时，也会进入回退清理路径。如果默认加载器本身失败，模型加载将失败。"

msgid "Source-lease release runs asynchronously with bounded retries. A pending release delays Seed publication without discarding the loaded model; publication can resume after release is acknowledged. Exhausted release retries or incomplete cleanup suppress publication. A Seed service startup or advertisement failure also **keeps the loaded model**, with no checkpoint reload. When dynamic EPLB disables RFork, the loader bypasses this flow and uses the default loader directly."
msgstr "源端租约通过异步方式释放，并设置有限的重试次数。释放尚未完成时会延迟发布 Seed，但不会丢弃已加载模型；确认释放后可以继续发布。重试次数耗尽或清理未完成时，不会发布 Seed。Seed 服务启动或上报失败时也会**保留已加载模型**，无需重新读取检查点。动态 EPLB 导致 RFork 被禁用时，加载器会跳过此流程，直接使用默认加载器。"

msgid "Release logs include a hashed lease identifier, attempt count, elapsed acquisition-to-release time, HTTP status and a bounded response excerpt with control characters removed and the lease ID redacted. These allow diagnosis without printing the raw USER_ID credential. Per-request timeouts are connect/read inactivity limits, not a strict total wall-clock deadline."
msgstr "释放日志包含哈希后的租约标识、尝试次数、从获取到释放的耗时、HTTP 状态，以及长度受限的响应摘要；摘要会去除控制字符并隐藏租约 ID。这些信息可用于诊断，同时避免输出原始 USER_ID 凭据。每次请求的超时限制针对连接或读取阶段的无活动时间，并非严格的总耗时上限。"

msgid "For example, start the planner with a 60-second lease TTL:"
msgstr "例如，使用 60 秒的租约 TTL 启动 Planner："

msgid "Increasing the lease TTL does not change the seed heartbeat TTL (`--heartbeat-ttl-sec`, default 60 seconds). The planner process reads these settings at startup; changing a client-side environment variable does not reconfigure a running planner."
msgstr "增大租约 TTL 不会改变 seed 心跳 TTL（`--heartbeat-ttl-sec`，默认 60 秒）。Planner 进程在启动时读取这些配置；修改客户端环境变量不会重新配置已运行的 Planner。"
